  "title": "Может помочь  (Can I help)",
  "level": "A1 — Duolingo Section 2",
  "labels": {
    "barinov": "Шеф",
    "fedya": "Федя"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The inspector has left Barinov with a fine and Fedya with an order to leave the country. Fedya asks the chef for help, and Barinov, out of ideas, thinks aloud.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Шеф, может, поможете?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Меня он оштрафовал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А тебя хотят депортировать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "И ничего нельзя сделать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Думаю, нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "С другим, может, договориться удастся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Хотя, если ты ему жизнь спасёшь...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Может, он нас и простит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Очень смешно, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Шеф, может, поможете?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, maybe you can help?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't know.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Меня он оштрафовал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He fined me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А тебя хотят депортировать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And they want to deport you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "И ничего нельзя сделать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And nothing can be done?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Думаю, нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't think so.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "С другим, может, договориться удастся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With someone else, maybe, we could strike a deal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Хотя, если ты ему жизнь спасёшь...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Though, if you save his life...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Может, он нас и простит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe he will even forgive us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Очень смешно, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Very funny, Chef.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
