      "t": "Очень смешно, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Barinov has no real rescue plan, only a grim joke. Notice how Russian drops 'can' at the start of a sentence on its own to mean 'maybe'. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну, удачи!",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
